PROGRAM member pricing

RECORD Order
  unit_price: decimal
  quantity: integer
  member: boolean

RECORD Quote
  total: decimal

REQUEST quote order
  GIVEN order is Order
  GIVEN quote is Quote
    total: 0.0
  WHEN quote order into quote
  OUTPUT quote is Quote
  THEN quote.total >= 0

WHEN quote <order> into <quote>
  GIVEN order is Order
  AND quote is Quote
  LET total be calculate total for order
  set quote.total to total

WHEN calculate total for <order>
  GIVEN order is Order
  THEN returns decimal
  LET subtotal be calculate subtotal for order
  LET rate be discount rate for order
  RETURN subtotal - subtotal * rate

WHEN calculate subtotal for <order>
  GIVEN order is Order
  THEN returns decimal
  REQUIRE order.unit_price >= 0
  REQUIRE order.quantity > 0
  RETURN order.unit_price * order.quantity

WHEN discount rate for <order>
  GIVEN order is Order
  THEN returns decimal
  DECIDE
    WHEN order.member
      RETURN 0.1
    ELSE
      RETURN 0.0

SCENARIO exact totals follow membership
GIVEN order is Order
  unit_price: <price>
  quantity: <quantity>
  member: <member>

REQUEST quote order

THEN quote.total == <total>

EXAMPLES
  | price | quantity | member | total |
  | 19.95 | 2        | false  | 39.9  |
  | 19.95 | 2        | true   | 35.91 |
  | 0.1   | 3        | true   | 0.27  |
  | 0.0   | 1        | false  | 0.0   |
